pan class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976200/extras/cf0b4fce912f13c4af9d18351b45e422.poster.avif?t=1788255581\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976200/extras/cf0b4fce912f13c4af9d18351b45e422.webm?t=1788255581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976200/extras/cf0b4fce912f13c4af9d18351b45e422.mp4?t=1788255581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting the punks is only half the job - real magic happens when you feed them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your <strong>mobile restaurant</strong>, collect or buy fresh ingredients, and discover a variety of<strong> tasty recipes</strong> across the city. Hit the grill and serve people exactly what they want. Earn money and spend it on better <strong>kitchen accessories</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true chef never stops learning. Use your hard-earned experience to upgrade your cooking skills and let your reputation echo through the streets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976200/extras/73fb4333488800401b2cdd2d13e6b03a.poster.avif?t=1788255581\" width=316 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976200/extras/73fb4333488800401b2cdd2d13e6b03a.webm?t=1788255581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976200/extras/73fb4333488800401b2cdd2d13e6b03a.mp4?t=1788255581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: 